== Walkthrough ==

''[[Tarker Blazetoss]] is at location 507, -408, -1 in the Wizard's Guild.''

You say, 'Hail, Tarker Blazetoss'

: Tarker Blazetoss says, 'Hail and well met, ______! Have you come to study, or can you [perform a task] for me this day?'

You say, 'I can perform a task'

: Tarker Blazetoss says, 'That is the spirit. There are many black wolves wandering Faydark these days. One of my brethren needs a black wolf skin as a component for his magic. Bring me a black wolf skin, and I shall reward you for your efforts.'

'''Hand [[Tarker Blazetoss]] a [[Black Wolf Skin]]. One at a time, as he seems to eat any more beyond the first for no reward.'''

: Tarker Blazetoss says, 'Ah yes. This is exactly what I need. Thank you very much.'

